// Lines spoken with a real voice (ElevenLabs text-to-speech, generated by
// scripts/gen-voices.mjs into nouveau/assets/voices/<id>.mp3). Every other line gets the
// speaker's little "voice" blips (nouveau/src/audio/voices.js).
// A dialogue line is voiced when its text is exactly one of these: keep them in sync
// with the story scripts.

